      <div class="secondary-navigation__desc-wrapper">
        
          <div class="secondary-navigation__content-description" id="residential" tabindex="0">
            <div class="secondary-navigation__title">
              <h2>Residential customers</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="secondary-navigation__description">
              
              <div><div class="text section">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-9790889c1b&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-10-01T21:54:02Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>In most cases, you can start or stop service on the same day you complete your request. You can also arrange to start up to 60 days in advance.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Solar customers&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>Solar customers must call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:18777434112\&#34;>1-877-743-4112&lt;/a> to start service.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;img width=\&#34;16\&#34; alt=\&#34;\&#34; src=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>Only Net Energy Metering Aggregation (NEM2A) solar customers can start service online.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Explore residential rate plans&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/rate-plans.html\&#34;>Visit rate plans&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-9790889c1b" class="cmp-text">
    <p>In most cases, you can start or stop service on the same day you complete your request. You can also arrange to start up to 60 days in advance.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Solar customers</h4>
<p>Solar customers must call <a href="tel:18777434112">1-877-743-4112</a> to start service.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><img width="16" alt="" src="https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg"/> <b>Note: </b>Only Net Energy Metering Aggregation (NEM2A) solar customers can start service online.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Explore residential rate plans</h4>
<ul><li><a href="/en/account/rate-plans.html">Visit rate plans</a>.</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="faq-accordion section">
   <div class="cmp-accordion-faq">
      <div class="cmp-accordion-faq__container">
         <div class="text">


    

</div>
         <div class="show-hide-links">
            <div class="button button--link-show-more show-all_link">
