               <i class="icon icon--minus-circle" aria-hidden="true">
               </i>
               <span class="cmp-button__text">Hide all</span>
               </a>
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="accordion">  <div id="accordion-3aecc869e1" class="cmp-accordion" data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-3aecc869e1&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-29T22:03:17Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
 <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-3aecc869e1-item-17f98e4da8&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How to start gas and electric service&#34;}}" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-17f98e4da8">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-17f98e4da8-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-17f98e4da8-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How to start gas and electric service</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-17f98e4da8-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-17f98e4da8-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-cc5ea329a4&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-09-04T22:37:40Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;img width=\&#34;16\&#34; alt=\&#34;\&#34; src=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Note:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;Only Net Energy Metering Aggregation (NEM2A) solar customers can start service online. Solar customers must call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-743-4112\&#34;>1-877-743-4112&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;to start service.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>New PG&amp;amp;E customer&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Go to pge.com and click “Register.”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Confirm you’re a new PG&amp;amp;E customer.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Confirm you want a residential account.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Enter your new service address.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Verify safe access to your meter.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Pick a start date within the next 60 days.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Verify your identification.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Review your information.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Submit your request.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;img width=\&#34;16\&#34; alt=\&#34;\&#34; src=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>Former PG&amp;amp;E customers who are starting service again must register as new customers.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Current PG&amp;amp;E customer adding another service address&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/helpmemove\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Sign into your online account&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Go to the My Account dashboard.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select &amp;quot;Add Another Address.&amp;quot;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Enter your new service address.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Verify safe access to your meter.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Pick a start date within the next 60 days.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Review your information.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Submit your request.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Are you a current customer without an online account?&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Option 1. Create an account to start, stop or transfer service&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>You’ll need:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Your current phone number and email&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your account number&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your ZIP code&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/register\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Create an online account&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Option 2. Call a PG&amp;amp;E customer representative at &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:18776606789\&#34;>1-877-660-6789&lt;/a>.&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>You’ll need:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Your current phone number and email&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your account number&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your ZIP code&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Who can&#39;t request service online?&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>In the following cases, you’ll need to speak to a customer service agent to start service:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Newly built homes.&lt;/b> You&#39;re the first occupant in a new home and the builder hasn&#39;t started gas or electric service.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Credit issues.&lt;/b> You had previous credit issues with PG&amp;amp;E, including having service turned off for nonpayment.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>All solar customers other than NEM2A.&lt;/b> Please call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:18777434112\&#34;>1-877-743-4112&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If any of these situations apply, call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:18776606789\&#34;>1-877-660-6789&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-cc5ea329a4" class="cmp-text">
    <p><img width="16" alt="" src="https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg"/> <b>Note:</b> Only Net Energy Metering Aggregation (NEM2A) solar customers can start service online. Solar customers must call <a href="tel:1-877-743-4112">1-877-743-4112</a> to start service.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><b>New PG&amp;E customer</b></p>
<ol><li>Go to pge.com and click “Register.”</li><li>Confirm you’re a new PG&amp;E customer.</li><li>Confirm you want a residential account.</li><li>Enter your new service address.</li><li>Verify safe access to your meter.</li><li>Pick a start date within the next 60 days.</li><li>Verify your identification.</li><li>Review your information.</li><li>Submit your request.</li></ol>
<p><img width="16" alt="" src="https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg"/> <b>Note: </b>Former PG&amp;E customers who are starting service again must register as new customers.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><b>Current PG&amp;E customer adding another service address</b></p>
<ol><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/helpmemove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sign into your online account</a>.</li><li>Go to the My Account dashboard.</li><li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service”</li><li>Select &#34;Add Another Address.&#34;</li><li>Enter your new service address.</li><li>Verify safe access to your meter.</li><li>Pick a start date within the next 60 days.</li><li>Review your information.</li><li>Submit your request.</li></ol>
<p> </p>
<h4>Are you a current customer without an online account?</h4>
<p><b>Option 1. Create an account to start, stop or transfer service</b></p>
<p>You’ll need:</p>
<ul><li>Your current phone number and email</li><li>Your account number</li><li>Your ZIP code</li></ul>
<p><a href="https://www.pge.com/register" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Create an online account</a></p>
<p> </p>
<p><b>Option 2. Call a PG&amp;E customer representative at <a href="tel:18776606789">1-877-660-6789</a>.</b></p>
<p>You’ll need:</p>
<ul><li>Your current phone number and email</li><li>Your account number</li><li>Your ZIP code</li></ul>
<p> </p>
<h4>Who can&#39;t request service online?</h4>
<p>In the following cases, you’ll need to speak to a customer service agent to start service:</p>
<ul><li><b>Newly built homes.</b> You&#39;re the first occupant in a new home and the builder hasn&#39;t started gas or electric service.</li><li><b>Credit issues.</b> You had previous credit issues with PG&amp;E, including having service turned off for nonpayment.</li><li><b>All solar customers other than NEM2A.</b> Please call <a href="tel:18777434112">1-877-743-4112</a>.</li></ul>
<p> </p>
<p>If any of these situations apply, call <a href="tel:18776606789">1-877-660-6789</a>.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-3aecc869e1-item-a2274adb6d&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How to stop gas and electric service&#34;}}" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-a2274adb6d">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-a2274adb6d-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-a2274adb6d-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How to stop gas and electric service</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-a2274adb6d-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-a2274adb6d-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-5cef7154de&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-29T22:32:41Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;b>Have an online account?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/helpmemove\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Sign into your online account&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Go to the My Account dashboard.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service.”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Have an online account?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Please call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:18776606789\&#34;>1-877-660-6789&lt;/a> to stop gas or electric service.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Don’t see an option to stop service?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you don&#39;t see an option to stop service, it may mean:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Your service request is in progress.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your service has already stopped.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-5cef7154de" class="cmp-text">
    <p><b>Have an online account?</b></p>
<ol><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/helpmemove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sign into your online account</a>.</li><li>Go to the My Account dashboard.</li><li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service.”</li></ol>
<p> </p>
<p><b>Have an online account?</b></p>
<p>Please call <a href="tel:18776606789">1-877-660-6789</a> to stop gas or electric service.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><b>Don’t see an option to stop service?</b></p>
<p>If you don&#39;t see an option to stop service, it may mean:</p>
<ul><li>Your service request is in progress.</li><li>Your service has already stopped.</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-3aecc869e1-item-7781b68f39&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Fumigation: How to stop or start gas service&#34;}}" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-7781b68f39">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-7781b68f39-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-7781b68f39-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Fumigation: How to stop or start gas service</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-7781b68f39-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-7781b68f39-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-e24c1da153&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-29T22:35:47Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h4>Before fumigation: Stop gas service&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>Before a service technician comes to your location, please confirm safe access to your meter on the day of service. Include a gate code or other access information in your request.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>After fumigation: Restart gas service&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>Once fumigation is complete, schedule a time to restart service. Make sure the building is safe to enter. Before we arrive for your appointment:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>The fumigation company must post a “Notice of Re-entry&amp;quot; at the building.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You must provide access to the location and its gas appliances&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You must report the type of fumigant that was used.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>PG&amp;amp;E recommends having your fumigation company submit these service requests. The request to stop or start service for fumigation must be emailed &lt;b>at least two business days in advance&lt;/b>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;mailto:customerserviceonline@pge.com?subject=Fumigation%20Request%3A%20Turn-Off%20Gas%20Service%20&amp;amp;body=%0ANote%3A%20You%20must%20send%20this%20request%202%20or%20more%20days%20ahead%20of%20your%20desired%20service%20date.%20We%20will%20follow%20up%20by%20phone%20or%20email%20with%20confirmation%20of%20your%20scheduled%20service.%20%0A%0AType%20of%20request%3A%20%20%0AShut%20off%20gas%20for%20fumigation%09%5B%20%20%20%20%5D%0ATurn%20on%20gas%20after%20fumigation%09%5B%20%20%20%20%5D%0A%0ADate%20you%20would%20like%20to%20schedule%20service%3A%20%0A%0AFumigation%20company%20name%3A%20%0A%0AType%20of%20fumigant%3A%20%0A%0ACONTACT%20INFORMATION%0A%0AFirst%20name%3A%20%0A%0ALast%20name%3A%20%0A%0AEmail%20address%3A%20%0A%0APhone%20number%3A%20%0A%0ASERVICE%20ADDRESS%20INFORMATION%20%0A%0AStreet%20address%3A%20%20%0A%0ACity%3A%0A%0AZIP%20code%3A%20%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20gas%20appliances%3A%20%0A%0ADoes%20the%20property%20have%20a%20dog%2C%20a%20locked%20gate%20or%20anything%20that%20will%20prevent%20access%20to%20meter%3F%20Please%20ensure%20access%20is%20available%20on%20the%20day%20of%20service.%20%0A%0AIf%20applicable%2C%20gate%20code%20or%20other%20access%20information%3A%20%20%20%0A%0A\&#34;>Fumigation Gas: Stop/Restart email request&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-e24c1da153" class="cmp-text">
    <h4>Before fumigation: Stop gas service</h4>
<p>Before a service technician comes to your location, please confirm safe access to your meter on the day of service. Include a gate code or other access information in your request.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>After fumigation: Restart gas service</h4>
<p>Once fumigation is complete, schedule a time to restart service. Make sure the building is safe to enter. Before we arrive for your appointment:</p>
<ul><li>The fumigation company must post a “Notice of Re-entry&#34; at the building.</li><li>You must provide access to the location and its gas appliances</li><li>You must report the type of fumigant that was used.</li></ul>
<p>PG&amp;E recommends having your fumigation company submit these service requests. The request to stop or start service for fumigation must be emailed <b>at least two business days in advance</b>.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><a href="mailto:customerserviceonline&#64;pge.com?subject&#61;Fumigation%20Request%3A%20Turn-Off%20Gas%20Service%20&amp;body&#61;%0ANote%3A%20You%20must%20send%20this%20request%202%20or%20more%20days%20ahead%20of%20your%20desired%20service%20date.%20We%20will%20follow%20up%20by%20phone%20or%20email%20with%20confirmation%20of%20your%20scheduled%20service.%20%0A%0AType%20of%20request%3A%20%20%0AShut%20off%20gas%20for%20fumigation%09%5B%20%20%20%20%5D%0ATurn%20on%20gas%20after%20fumigation%09%5B%20%20%20%20%5D%0A%0ADate%20you%20would%20like%20to%20schedule%20service%3A%20%0A%0AFumigation%20company%20name%3A%20%0A%0AType%20of%20fumigant%3A%20%0A%0ACONTACT%20INFORMATION%0A%0AFirst%20name%3A%20%0A%0ALast%20name%3A%20%0A%0AEmail%20address%3A%20%0A%0APhone%20number%3A%20%0A%0ASERVICE%20ADDRESS%20INFORMATION%20%0A%0AStreet%20address%3A%20%20%0A%0ACity%3A%0A%0AZIP%20code%3A%20%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20gas%20appliances%3A%20%0A%0ADoes%20the%20property%20have%20a%20dog%2C%20a%20locked%20gate%20or%20anything%20that%20will%20prevent%20access%20to%20meter%3F%20Please%20ensure%20access%20is%20available%20on%20the%20day%20of%20service.%20%0A%0AIf%20applicable%2C%20gate%20code%20or%20other%20access%20information%3A%20%20%20%0A%0A">Fumigation Gas: Stop/Restart email request</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-3aecc869e1-item-44f9ef0098&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How to move service to another address served by PG&amp;E&#34;}}" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-44f9ef0098">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-44f9ef0098-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-44f9ef0098-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How to move service to another address served by PG&amp;E</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-44f9ef0098-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-44f9ef0098-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-db255d463c&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-29T22:40:19Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;b>Are you an existing customer moving within PG&amp;amp;E’s service area?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>To stop service on your current home and start service on your new home in a single transaction:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/helpmemove\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34;>Sign into your account&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Go to the My Account dashboard.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service.”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-db255d463c" class="cmp-text">
    <p><b>Are you an existing customer moving within PG&amp;E’s service area?</b></p>
<p>To stop service on your current home and start service on your new home in a single transaction:</p>
<ol><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/helpmemove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sign into your account</a>.</li><li>Go to the My Account dashboard.</li><li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service.”</li></ol>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-3aecc869e1-item-5f27ba9ff3&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Restart service after shutoff for non-payment&#34;}}" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-5f27ba9ff3">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-5f27ba9ff3-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-5f27ba9ff3-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Restart service after shutoff for non-payment</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-5f27ba9ff3-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-5f27ba9ff3-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-9741fb5847&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-09-04T22:37:58Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;div>&lt;b>There are two ways to pay:&lt;/b>&lt;/div>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>By phone&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>At an authorized Neighborhood Payment Center (NPC)&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;img width=\&#34;16\&#34; alt=\&#34;\&#34; src=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Note:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;To restore service, you must pay the full amount due. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h6>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h6>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Pay by phone&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Call our payment center at any time at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-704-8470\&#34;>1-877-704-8470&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>You may use:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Visa, MasterCard or Discover&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>ATM or debit card with a Star, Accel, Pulse or NYCE symbol&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Electronic check&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Google or Apple Pay&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;img width=\&#34;16\&#34; alt=\&#34;\&#34; src=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Note:&lt;/b>&amp;nbsp;You will be charged a small convenience fee for each transaction.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>After full payment is made, call us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-743-5950\&#34;>1-877-743-5950&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;with your confirmation number.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Once payment is verified, we’ll issue a service order to restore service.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;h6>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h6>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Pay at an authorized Neighborhood Payment Center (NPC)&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>To find an NPC near you, call&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-743-5950\&#34;>1-877-743-5950&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/billing-and-assistance/pay-my-bill/payment-center-locator.html\&#34; title=\&#34;PG&amp;amp;E Payment Center locator\&#34;>use our Payment Center Locator&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You MUST bring your 11-digit PG&amp;amp;E account number or a copy of your bill with you.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You may pay by cash, check, money order or cashier’s check.&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Walmart locations accept cash and PIN-based debit cards.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>After full payment is made, call us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-743-5950\&#34;>1-877-743-5950&lt;/a>.&amp;nbsp;&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Have your NPC receipt available.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Once payment is verified, we’ll issue a service order to restore service.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Need help paying your bill?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/billing-and-assistance/financial-assistance.html\&#34; title=\&#34;PG&amp;amp;E financial assistance programs\&#34;>Visit our financial assistance programs page&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Call&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-743-5950\&#34;>1-877-743-5950&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;for a list of agencies that may be able to help with your bill.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-9741fb5847" class="cmp-text">
    <div><b>There are two ways to pay:</b></div>
<ul><li>By phone</li><li>At an authorized Neighborhood Payment Center (NPC)</li></ul>
<p><img width="16" alt="" src="https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg"/> <b>Note:</b> To restore service, you must pay the full amount due.  </p>
<h6> </h6>
<p><b>Pay by phone</b></p>
<p>Call our payment center at any time at <a href="tel:1-877-704-8470">1-877-704-8470</a>.</p>
<p>You may use:</p>
<ul><li>Visa, MasterCard or Discover</li><li>ATM or debit card with a Star, Accel, Pulse or NYCE symbol</li><li>Electronic check<br />
</li><li>Google or Apple Pay</li></ul>
<p><img width="16" alt="" src="https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg"/> <b>Note:</b> You will be charged a small convenience fee for each transaction.</p>
<ol><li>After full payment is made, call us at <a href="tel:1-877-743-5950">1-877-743-5950</a> with your confirmation number.</li><li>Once payment is verified, we’ll issue a service order to restore service.</li></ol>
<h6> </h6>
<p><b>Pay at an authorized Neighborhood Payment Center (NPC)</b></p>
<ol><li>To find an NPC near you, call <a href="tel:1-877-743-5950">1-877-743-5950</a> or <a href="/en/account/billing-and-assistance/pay-my-bill/payment-center-locator.html" title="PG&amp;E Payment Center locator">use our Payment Center Locator</a>.</li><li>You MUST bring your 11-digit PG&amp;E account number or a copy of your bill with you.</li><li>You may pay by cash, check, money order or cashier’s check.<ul><li>Walmart locations accept cash and PIN-based debit cards.</li></ul>
</li><li>After full payment is made, call us at <a href="tel:1-877-743-5950">1-877-743-5950</a>. <ul><li>Have your NPC receipt available. </li><li>Once payment is verified, we’ll issue a service order to restore service.</li></ul>
</li></ol>
<p> </p>
<p><b>Need help paying your bill?</b></p>
<ul><li><a href="/en/account/billing-and-assistance/financial-assistance.html" title="PG&amp;E financial assistance programs">Visit our financial assistance programs page</a></li><li>Call <a href="tel:1-877-743-5950">1-877-743-5950</a> for a list of agencies that may be able to help with your bill.</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-3aecc869e1-item-40b69369a3&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Switch service to another person’s name&#34;}}" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-40b69369a3">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-40b69369a3-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-40b69369a3-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Switch service to another person’s name</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-40b69369a3-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-3aecc869e1-item-40b69369a3-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-e9cccaf508&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-09-04T22:38:09Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>In cases where a spouse has passed away, service may be transferred to the surviving spouse.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Please call Customer Service at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-660-6789\&#34;>1-877-660-6789&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>In all other cases, &lt;b>you cannot switch or transfer service between two people&lt;/b>.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>You must stop your existing service.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The other person will start the new service using their credentials.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;img width=\&#34;16\&#34; alt=\&#34;\&#34; src=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>To avoid a service disruption, schedule stop and start service for the same day.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-e9cccaf508" class="cmp-text">
    <p>In cases where a spouse has passed away, service may be transferred to the surviving spouse.</p>
<ul><li>Please call Customer Service at <a href="tel:1-877-660-6789">1-877-660-6789</a>.</li></ul>
<p>In all other cases, <b>you cannot switch or transfer service between two people</b>.</p>
<ol><li>You must stop your existing service.</li><li>The other person will start the new service using their credentials.</li></ol>
<p><img width="16" alt="" src="https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg"/> <b>Note: </b>To avoid a service disruption, schedule stop and start service for the same day.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>

 
</div>
</div>
      </div>
   </div>

</div>

</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="secondary-navigation__content-description" id="business" tabindex="0">
            <div class="secondary-navigation__title">
              <h2>Business customers</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="secondary-navigation__description">
              
              <div><div class="text section">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-7f89272e8e&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-29T22:47:07Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;b>Most business customers can start or stop their gas and electric service online.&lt;/b>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Start or stop service on the same day you complete your request.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Arrange for service up to 60 days in advance.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Have questions about our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a title=\&#34;Time-of-Use rate plans for businesses\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/rate-plans/time-of-use-rate-plans.html#TOUbizRates\&#34;>business rate plan options&lt;/a>, energy assessments or programs? Contact us Monday through Friday between 7 a.m. to 6 p.m.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Business customers:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-800-468-4743\&#34;>1-800-468-4743&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Agricultural customers:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-311-3276\&#34;>1-877-311-3276&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Solar customers:&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-743-4112\&#34; style=\&#34;background-color: rgb(255,255,255);\&#34;>1-877-743-4112&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-7f89272e8e" class="cmp-text">
    <p><b>Most business customers can start or stop their gas and electric service online.</b><br />
</p>
<ul><li>Start or stop service on the same day you complete your request.</li><li>Arrange for service up to 60 days in advance.</li></ul>
<p><b>Have questions about our <a title="Time-of-Use rate plans for businesses" href="/en/account/rate-plans/time-of-use-rate-plans.html#TOUbizRates">business rate plan options</a>, energy assessments or programs? Contact us Monday through Friday between 7 a.m. to 6 p.m. </b></p>
<ul><li>Business customers: <a href="tel:1-800-468-4743">1-800-468-4743</a></li><li>Agricultural customers: <a href="tel:1-877-311-3276">1-877-311-3276</a></li><li>Solar customers: <a href="tel:1-877-743-4112" style="	background-color: rgb(255,255,255);
">1-877-743-4112</a></li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>
