         <div class="accordion">  <div id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c" class="cmp-accordion" data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-6b2dc35c8c&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-29T22:48:20Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
 <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-756868c942&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-07-27T19:19:58Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How do I start gas and electric service at a business?&#34;}}" id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-756868c942">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-756868c942-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-756868c942-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How do I start gas and electric service at a business?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-756868c942-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-756868c942-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-179c0f869d&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-09-04T22:38:21Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h4>New PG&amp;amp;E customer&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Go to pge.com and click “Register.”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Confirm you’re a new PG&amp;amp;E customer.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Confirm you have a business account.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Enter your new service address.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If you have multiple accounts, you’ll be prompted to select one from a dropdown.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Verify safe access to your meter.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select a start date within the next 60 days.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Define your business.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select a rate plan.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Choose related programs.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Provide contact information.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Review your information.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Submit your request.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;img width=\&#34;16\&#34; alt=\&#34;\&#34; src=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>Former PG&amp;amp;E customers who are starting service again must register as new customers.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Current PG&amp;amp;E customer adding another service address&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/helpmemove\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Sign into your online account&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Go to the My Account dashboard.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select &amp;quot;Add Another Address.&amp;quot;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Enter your new service address.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If you have multiple accounts, you’ll be prompted to select one from a dropdown.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Verify safe access to your meter.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select a start date within the next 60 days.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Define your business.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select a rate plan.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Choose related programs.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Provide contact information.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Review your information.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Submit your request.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Current PG&amp;amp;E customer without an online account&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>To create an online account, you’ll need:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Your current phone number and email&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your account number&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your ZIP code&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/register\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Create an online account&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>In lieu of deposit&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>If your new service requires a deposit, you may be able to have it waived.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Follow the steps under &lt;a href=\&#34;#SecurityDepositBIZ\&#34;>Security deposit options: In lieu of deposit&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Rate plans for businesses&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Learn about the different types of business rate plans we offer.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/rate-plans/time-of-use-rate-plans.html#TOUbizRates\&#34;>Explore business rates&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Meter set for multiple properties&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>Use our online form to make a request to start service.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Appointment dates should be requested a minimum of two working days in advance&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Appointments should NOT be scheduled on a:&amp;nbsp;&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Saturday&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Sunday&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Holiday&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If resources are available, we will accomodate four-hour appointment timeframes.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If resources are unavailable on the day or time you want, appointments will be scheduled as a 12-hour (8 a.m. to 8 p.m.) timeframe.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Choose from 1 to 25 properties and provide information for each.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a title=\&#34;Meter set for multiple properties (Form)\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/service-requests/meter-set-for-more-than-one-property.html\&#34;>Request to start service for multiple properties&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p style=\&#34;padding-bottom: 15.0px;\&#34;>&lt;b>Have an online account?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Sign in with your username and password.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>On your dashboard, select &lt;i>Stop Service&lt;/i> under&lt;i> Service Requests&lt;/i>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select the address where you want to stop service.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Select a date to stop service:&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Are you removing gas appliances or cleaning with flammable solvents? Make an in-person appointment with a PG&amp;amp;E technician to stop service at your location.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If you are NOT removing gas appliances or cleaning with flammable solvents, select a date within 60 days to stop service.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Provide your contact information.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Review and submit your request.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>You will receive an email from PG&amp;amp;E confirming the receipt of your request to stop service.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/helpmemove\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Sign in&lt;/a>&lt;br>\r\n&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Check the status of your request&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Review the status of your stop service request on your online account dashboard.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>It can be found in the &lt;i>Service Requests&lt;/i> section.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Don’t see an option to Stop Service?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you don&#39;t see an option to stop service, it may mean:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>It&#39;s in progress or&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your service has been stopped&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>We will offer four-hour appointment timeframes if resources permit. If resources are not available at your preferred time, appointments will be scheduled within a 12-hour window (8 a.m. to 8 p.m.).&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/service-requests/meter-set-for-more-than-one-property.html\&#34;>Request to start service for up to 25 properties&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Who can&#39;t request service online?&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>In the following cases, you’ll need to speak to a customer service agent to start service:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>New buildings&lt;/b>. You&#39;re the first occupant in a brand-new building and the builder hasn&#39;t started service on a business rate.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Credit issues&lt;/b>. You had previous credit issues with PG&amp;amp;E, including having service turned off for non-payment.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>All solar customers but NEM2A&lt;/b>. Please call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:18777434112\&#34;>1-877-743-4112&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;b>Other rates&lt;/b>. You want to start electric service on a rate other than our main small and medium business rates.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If any of these situations apply, please contact us:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Business customers, call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-800-468-4743\&#34;>1-800-468-4743&lt;/a>, Monday through Friday, 7 a.m. to 6 p.m.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Agricultural customers, call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-311-3276\&#34;>1-877-311-3276&lt;/a>, Monday through Friday, 7 a.m. to 6 p.m.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Solar customers, call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-743-4112\&#34;>1-877-743-4112&lt;/a>, Monday through Friday, 7 a.m. to 6 p.m.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-179c0f869d" class="cmp-text">
    <h4>New PG&amp;E customer</h4>
<ol><li>Go to pge.com and click “Register.”</li><li>Confirm you’re a new PG&amp;E customer.</li><li>Confirm you have a business account.</li><li>Enter your new service address.</li><li>If you have multiple accounts, you’ll be prompted to select one from a dropdown.</li><li>Verify safe access to your meter.</li><li>Select a start date within the next 60 days.</li><li>Define your business.</li><li>Select a rate plan.</li><li>Choose related programs.</li><li>Provide contact information.</li><li>Review your information.</li><li>Submit your request.</li></ol>
<p><img width="16" alt="" src="https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg"/> <b>Note: </b>Former PG&amp;E customers who are starting service again must register as new customers.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Current PG&amp;E customer adding another service address</h4>
<ol><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/helpmemove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sign into your online account</a>.</li><li>Go to the My Account dashboard.</li><li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service”</li><li>Select &#34;Add Another Address.&#34;</li><li>Enter your new service address.</li><li>If you have multiple accounts, you’ll be prompted to select one from a dropdown.</li><li>Verify safe access to your meter.</li><li>Select a start date within the next 60 days.</li><li>Define your business.</li><li>Select a rate plan.</li><li>Choose related programs.</li><li>Provide contact information.</li><li>Review your information.</li><li>Submit your request.</li></ol>
<p> </p>
<h4>Current PG&amp;E customer without an online account</h4>
<p>To create an online account, you’ll need:</p>
<ul><li>Your current phone number and email</li><li>Your account number</li><li>Your ZIP code</li></ul>
<p><a href="https://www.pge.com/register" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Create an online account</a></p>
<p> </p>
<h4>In lieu of deposit</h4>
<p>If your new service requires a deposit, you may be able to have it waived.</p>
<ul><li>Follow the steps under <a href="#SecurityDepositBIZ">Security deposit options: In lieu of deposit</a>.</li></ul>
<p><b>Rate plans for businesses</b></p>
<p>Learn about the different types of business rate plans we offer.</p>
<ul><li><a href="/en/account/rate-plans/time-of-use-rate-plans.html#TOUbizRates">Explore business rates</a></li></ul>
<p> </p>
<h4>Meter set for multiple properties</h4>
<p>Use our online form to make a request to start service.</p>
<ul><li>Appointment dates should be requested a minimum of two working days in advance</li><li>Appointments should NOT be scheduled on a: <ul><li>Saturday</li><li>Sunday</li><li>Holiday</li></ul>
</li><li>If resources are available, we will accomodate four-hour appointment timeframes.</li><li>If resources are unavailable on the day or time you want, appointments will be scheduled as a 12-hour (8 a.m. to 8 p.m.) timeframe.</li><li>Choose from 1 to 25 properties and provide information for each. </li></ul>
<p><a title="Meter set for multiple properties (Form)" href="/en/account/service-requests/meter-set-for-more-than-one-property.html">Request to start service for multiple properties</a></p>
<p> </p>
<p style="	padding-bottom: 15.0px;
"><b>Have an online account?</b></p>
<ol><li>Sign in with your username and password.</li><li>On your dashboard, select <i>Stop Service</i> under<i> Service Requests</i>.</li><li>Select the address where you want to stop service.</li><li>Select a date to stop service:<ul><li>Are you removing gas appliances or cleaning with flammable solvents? Make an in-person appointment with a PG&amp;E technician to stop service at your location. </li><li>If you are NOT removing gas appliances or cleaning with flammable solvents, select a date within 60 days to stop service.<br />
</li></ul>
</li><li>Provide your contact information.</li><li>Review and submit your request.</li></ol>
<p>You will receive an email from PG&amp;E confirming the receipt of your request to stop service.</p>
<p><a href="https://www.pge.com/helpmemove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sign in</a><br />
<br />
</p>
<p><b>Check the status of your request</b></p>
<p>Review the status of your stop service request on your online account dashboard.</p>
<ul><li>It can be found in the <i>Service Requests</i> section.</li></ul>
<p> </p>
<p><b>Don’t see an option to Stop Service?</b></p>
<p>If you don&#39;t see an option to stop service, it may mean:</p>
<ul><li>It&#39;s in progress or</li><li>Your service has been stopped</li></ul>
<p>We will offer four-hour appointment timeframes if resources permit. If resources are not available at your preferred time, appointments will be scheduled within a 12-hour window (8 a.m. to 8 p.m.).</p>
<p> </p>
<p><a href="/en/account/service-requests/meter-set-for-more-than-one-property.html">Request to start service for up to 25 properties</a></p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Who can&#39;t request service online?</h4>
<p>In the following cases, you’ll need to speak to a customer service agent to start service:</p>
<ul><li><b>New buildings</b>. You&#39;re the first occupant in a brand-new building and the builder hasn&#39;t started service on a business rate.</li><li><b>Credit issues</b>. You had previous credit issues with PG&amp;E, including having service turned off for non-payment.</li><li><b>All solar customers but NEM2A</b>. Please call <a href="tel:18777434112">1-877-743-4112</a>.</li><li><b>Other rates</b>. You want to start electric service on a rate other than our main small and medium business rates.</li></ul>
<p> </p>
<p>If any of these situations apply, please contact us:</p>
<ul><li>Business customers, call <a href="tel:1-800-468-4743">1-800-468-4743</a>, Monday through Friday, 7 a.m. to 6 p.m.</li><li>Agricultural customers, call <a href="tel:1-877-311-3276">1-877-311-3276</a>, Monday through Friday, 7 a.m. to 6 p.m.</li><li>Solar customers, call <a href="tel:1-877-743-4112">1-877-743-4112</a>, Monday through Friday, 7 a.m. to 6 p.m.</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-4f618d32c5&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How to stop gas and electric service at a business&#34;}}" id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-4f618d32c5">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-4f618d32c5-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-4f618d32c5-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How to stop gas and electric service at a business</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-4f618d32c5-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-4f618d32c5-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-f9e52ee073&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T01:41:29Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;b>Do you have an online account?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/helpmemove\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34;>Sign into your online account&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Go to the My Account dashboard.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service.”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Don’t have an online account?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>Please call &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-660-6789\&#34;>1-877-660-6789&lt;/a> to stop gas or electric service.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;b>Don’t see an option to stop service?&lt;/b>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>If you don&#39;t see an option to stop service, it may mean:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Your service request is in progress.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your service has already stopped.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-f9e52ee073" class="cmp-text">
    <p><b>Do you have an online account?</b></p>
<ol><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/helpmemove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sign into your online account</a>.</li><li>Go to the My Account dashboard.</li><li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service.”</li></ol>
<p><b>Don’t have an online account?</b></p>
<p>Please call <a href="tel:1-877-660-6789">1-877-660-6789</a> to stop gas or electric service.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><b>Don’t see an option to stop service?</b></p>
<p>If you don&#39;t see an option to stop service, it may mean:</p>
<ul><li>Your service request is in progress.</li><li>Your service has already stopped.</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-7e62810f57&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Fumigation: How to stop and restart gas service&#34;}}" id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-7e62810f57">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-7e62810f57-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-7e62810f57-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Fumigation: How to stop and restart gas service</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-7e62810f57-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-7e62810f57-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-f89bd25c86&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T01:43:32Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h4>Before fumigation: Stop gas service&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>Before a service technician comes to your location, please confirm safe access to your meter on the day of service. Include a gate code or other access information in your request.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>After fumigation: Restart gas service&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>Once fumigation is complete, schedule a time to restart service. Make sure the building is safe to enter. Before we arrive for your appointment:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>The fumigation company must post a “Notice of Re-entry&amp;quot; at the building.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You must provide access to the location and its gas appliances&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>You must report the type of fumigant that was used.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>PG&amp;amp;E recommends having your fumigation company submit these service requests. The request to stop or start service for fumigation must be emailed at least two business days in advance.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;mailto:customerserviceonline@pge.com?subject=Fumigation%20Request%3A%20Turn-Off%20Gas%20Service%20&amp;amp;body=%0ANote%3A%20You%20must%20send%20this%20request%202%20or%20more%20days%20ahead%20of%20your%20desired%20service%20date.%20We%20will%20follow%20up%20by%20phone%20or%20email%20with%20confirmation%20of%20your%20scheduled%20service.%20%0A%0AType%20of%20request%3A%20%20%0AShut%20off%20gas%20for%20fumigation%09%5B%20%20%20%20%5D%0ATurn%20on%20gas%20after%20fumigation%09%5B%20%20%20%20%5D%0A%0ADate%20you%20would%20like%20to%20schedule%20service%3A%20%0A%0AFumigation%20company%20name%3A%20%0A%0AType%20of%20fumigant%3A%20%0A%0ACONTACT%20INFORMATION%0A%0AFirst%20name%3A%20%0A%0ALast%20name%3A%20%0A%0AEmail%20address%3A%20%0A%0APhone%20number%3A%20%0A%0ASERVICE%20ADDRESS%20INFORMATION%20%0A%0AStreet%20address%3A%20%20%0A%0ACity%3A%0A%0AZIP%20code%3A%20%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20gas%20appliances%3A%20%0A%0ADoes%20the%20property%20have%20a%20dog%2C%20a%20locked%20gate%20or%20anything%20that%20will%20prevent%20access%20to%20meter%3F%20Please%20ensure%20access%20is%20available%20on%20the%20day%20of%20service.%20%0A%0AIf%20applicable%2C%20gate%20code%20or%20other%20access%20information%3A%20%20%20%0A%0A\&#34;>Fumigation Gas: Stop/Restart email request&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-f89bd25c86" class="cmp-text">
    <h4>Before fumigation: Stop gas service</h4>
<p>Before a service technician comes to your location, please confirm safe access to your meter on the day of service. Include a gate code or other access information in your request.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>After fumigation: Restart gas service</h4>
<p>Once fumigation is complete, schedule a time to restart service. Make sure the building is safe to enter. Before we arrive for your appointment:</p>
<ul><li>The fumigation company must post a “Notice of Re-entry&#34; at the building.</li><li>You must provide access to the location and its gas appliances</li><li>You must report the type of fumigant that was used.</li></ul>
<p>PG&amp;E recommends having your fumigation company submit these service requests. The request to stop or start service for fumigation must be emailed at least two business days in advance. </p>
<p> </p>
<p><a href="mailto:customerserviceonline&#64;pge.com?subject&#61;Fumigation%20Request%3A%20Turn-Off%20Gas%20Service%20&amp;body&#61;%0ANote%3A%20You%20must%20send%20this%20request%202%20or%20more%20days%20ahead%20of%20your%20desired%20service%20date.%20We%20will%20follow%20up%20by%20phone%20or%20email%20with%20confirmation%20of%20your%20scheduled%20service.%20%0A%0AType%20of%20request%3A%20%20%0AShut%20off%20gas%20for%20fumigation%09%5B%20%20%20%20%5D%0ATurn%20on%20gas%20after%20fumigation%09%5B%20%20%20%20%5D%0A%0ADate%20you%20would%20like%20to%20schedule%20service%3A%20%0A%0AFumigation%20company%20name%3A%20%0A%0AType%20of%20fumigant%3A%20%0A%0ACONTACT%20INFORMATION%0A%0AFirst%20name%3A%20%0A%0ALast%20name%3A%20%0A%0AEmail%20address%3A%20%0A%0APhone%20number%3A%20%0A%0ASERVICE%20ADDRESS%20INFORMATION%20%0A%0AStreet%20address%3A%20%20%0A%0ACity%3A%0A%0AZIP%20code%3A%20%20%0A%0ANumber%20of%20gas%20appliances%3A%20%0A%0ADoes%20the%20property%20have%20a%20dog%2C%20a%20locked%20gate%20or%20anything%20that%20will%20prevent%20access%20to%20meter%3F%20Please%20ensure%20access%20is%20available%20on%20the%20day%20of%20service.%20%0A%0AIf%20applicable%2C%20gate%20code%20or%20other%20access%20information%3A%20%20%20%0A%0A">Fumigation Gas: Stop/Restart email request</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-8dd76c1693&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How to move a business to another address served by PG&amp;E&#34;}}" id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-8dd76c1693">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-8dd76c1693-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-8dd76c1693-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How to move a business to another address served by PG&amp;E</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-8dd76c1693-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-6b2dc35c8c-item-8dd76c1693-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0d40e1cdd9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T01:46:21Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>To stop service at your current business location and start service at a new location in a single transaction:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/helpmemove\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34;>Sign into your account&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Go to the My Account dashboard.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service.”&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>Don’t have an online account? It&#39;s easy to create one. You’ll need:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Your account number&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your phone number&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your ZIP code&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/register\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34;>Register for an online account now&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0d40e1cdd9" class="cmp-text">
    <p>To stop service at your current business location and start service at a new location in a single transaction:</p>
<ol><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/helpmemove" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sign into your account</a>.</li><li>Go to the My Account dashboard.</li><li>Click “Start, Stop or Transfer Service.”</li></ol>
<p>Don’t have an online account? It&#39;s easy to create one. You’ll need:</p>
<ul><li>Your account number</li><li>Your phone number</li><li>Your ZIP code</li></ul>
<p><a href="https://www.pge.com/register" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Register for an online account now</a></p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>

 
</div>
</div>
      </div>
   </div>

</div>
<div class="faq-accordion section">
   <div class="cmp-accordion-faq">
      <div class="cmp-accordion-faq__container">
         <div class="text">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-6d6fd68c80&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T01:46:40Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h3>&lt;a id=\&#34;SecurityDepositBIZ\&#34;>&lt;/a>Security deposit options for businesses&lt;/h3>\r\n&lt;p>Starting service with a business account requires a deposit. This amount will be applied to your first bill.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-6d6fd68c80" class="cmp-text">
    <h3><a id="SecurityDepositBIZ"></a>Security deposit options for businesses</h3>
<p>Starting service with a business account requires a deposit. This amount will be applied to your first bill.</p>

</div>

    

</div>
         <div class="show-hide-links">
            <div class="button button--link-show-more show-all_link">
               <a class="cmp-button" href="#">
               <i class="icon icon--plus-circle" aria-hidden="true">
               </i>
               <span class="cmp-button__text">Show all</span>
               </a>
            </div>
            <div class="button button--link-show-more hide-all_link">
               <a class="cmp-button" href="#">
               <i class="icon icon--minus-circle" aria-hidden="true">
               </i>
               <span class="cmp-button__text">Hide all</span>
               </a>
            </div>
         </div>
         <div class="accordion">  <div id="accordion-f5761d9297" class="cmp-accordion" data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f5761d9297&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T02:00:31Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
 <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f5761d9297-item-2974b2706c&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Cash deposit&#34;}}" id="accordion-f5761d9297-item-2974b2706c">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f5761d9297-item-2974b2706c-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f5761d9297-item-2974b2706c-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Cash deposit</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f5761d9297-item-2974b2706c-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f5761d9297-item-2974b2706c-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-309b20bf5f&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T01:47:52Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>After receiving your first bill, pay your deposit:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/myaccount\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Online&amp;nbsp;with your bank account or credit card&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>By mail&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>With cash or check in person&amp;nbsp;at a &lt;a title=\&#34;Pay Center Locator\&#34; href=\&#34;/content/pge/language-masters/en/account/billing-and-assistance/pay-my-bill/payment-center-locator.html\&#34;>neighborhood payment center&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Your deposit will accrue interest at the three-month commercial paper rate as published in the Federal Reserve Statistical Release, H-15.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Do you want to spread payment of your deposit over several months?&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/myaccount\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34;>Schedule a pay plan online&lt;/a>.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Call our Customer Service Center at &lt;a href=\&#34;tel:18004684743\&#34;>1-800-468-4743&lt;/a> to schedule a pay plan.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-309b20bf5f" class="cmp-text">
    <p>After receiving your first bill, pay your deposit:</p>
<ul><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/myaccount" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Online with your bank account or credit card</a></li><li>By mail</li><li>With cash or check in person at a <a title="Pay Center Locator" href="/en/account/billing-and-assistance/pay-my-bill/payment-center-locator.html">neighborhood payment center</a></li></ul>
<p>Your deposit will accrue interest at the three-month commercial paper rate as published in the Federal Reserve Statistical Release, H-15.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Do you want to spread payment of your deposit over several months?</h4>
<ul><li><a href="https://www.pge.com/myaccount" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Schedule a pay plan online</a>.</li><li>Call our Customer Service Center at <a href="tel:18004684743">1-800-468-4743</a> to schedule a pay plan.</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f5761d9297-item-974de11fe2&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;In Lieu of Deposit&#34;}}" id="accordion-f5761d9297-item-974de11fe2">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f5761d9297-item-974de11fe2-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f5761d9297-item-974de11fe2-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">In Lieu of Deposit</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f5761d9297-item-974de11fe2-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f5761d9297-item-974de11fe2-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0398dad8bb&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-10-01T21:54:35Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;h4>&lt;a id=\&#34;inlieuofdeposit\&#34;>&lt;/a>Eligibility&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>All commercial rates are eligible for the In Lieu of Deposit program. Otherwise, you must:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Be a new PG&amp;amp;E customer with a deposit amount of less than or equal to $10,000&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Enroll before the third billing statement is generated for your account.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Maintain recurring payments and paperless billing on your account for 12 billing cycles.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>How to waive the security deposit&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Sign up for paperless billing.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Sign up for autopay and choose “Pay Bill in Full” by the due date using a checking or savings account.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Keep paperless billing and recurring payments active for 12 months in a row.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The deposit will be re-applied to your account if:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>A recurring payment fails.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The monthly balance is not paid in full.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Your account is unenrolled from recurring payments or paperless billing.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Surety Bond&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;ol>\r\n&lt;li>Obtain a bond from your insurance company in the amount of the deposit request&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>List PG&amp;amp;E as the sole beneficiary.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Complete the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;/content/dam/pge/docs/account/service-requests/Sec-Deposit-Surety-Bond-GAS-FORMS-62-4042.pdf\&#34;>Surety Bond form (PDF)&lt;/a>&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;a href=\&#34;mailto:bonddesk@pge.com\&#34;>Email&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;copies of the form and the Surety bond to PG&amp;amp;E.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>PG&amp;amp;E will notify you once the form is accepted. We&#39;ll then ask you to mail the original documents to:&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ol>\r\n&lt;p>Pacific Gas and Electric Company&lt;br>\r\nATTN: Bond Desk&lt;br>\r\nP. O. Box 8329&lt;br>\r\nStockton, CA 95208-0010.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Irrevocable letter of credit&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>Have your banking institution complete and indicate that it will fully guarantee any bill that is submitted for payment without prejudice or question.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>What are the requirements in the acceptance of an Irrevocable Letter of Credit?&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>An Irrevocable Letter of Credit is completed by your banking institution and must be typed and not handwritten, with the exception of signatures.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Issue in the account name as the PG&amp;amp;E account is held, cannot be issued to a dba (doing business as) name&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>No service address, mailing address or PG&amp;amp;E account number should be listed on the Irrevocable Letter of Credit&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The bank officer or bank employee’s signature signing the Irrevocable Letter of Credit must be notarized, and accompanied by the notary’s All-Purpose Acknowledgement form (the optional section of the acknowledgement must be completed or have the bank’s officer/employees business card attached)&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>The completed Irrevocable &lt;a>&lt;/a>&lt;a aria-label=\&#34;Letter of Credit Form\&#34; href=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/tariffs/assets/pdf/tariffbook/GAS_FORMS_79-1043.pdf\&#34; target=\&#34;_blank\&#34; rel=\&#34;noopener noreferrer\&#34;>Letter of Credit form&lt;/a>&amp;nbsp;should be emailed to PG&amp;amp;E for acceptance to &lt;a href=\&#34;mailto:bonddesk@pge.com\&#34;>bonddesk@pge.com&lt;/a>&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>PG&amp;amp;E will notify you once the form is accepted. We&#39;ll then ask you to mail the original documents to:&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Pacific Gas and Electric Company&lt;br>\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;ATTN: Bond Desk&lt;br>\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;P. O. Box 8329&lt;br>\r\n&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;Stockton, CA 95208-0010.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;h4>Bill guarantee&lt;/h4>\r\n&lt;p>This must be signed by a guarantor who assumes all financial responsibility for the specified guaranteed amount in the event the customer fails to pay the closing bill.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The guarantor must be an established commercial customer with:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>12 consecutive months of service&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>No more than two late payments&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The average monthly billings equal to at least 50 percent of the amount to be guaranteed.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Ask your guarantor to contact the Credit Department. We must verify that they meet the guidelines before we send them the form.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0398dad8bb" class="cmp-text">
    <h4><a id="inlieuofdeposit"></a>Eligibility</h4>
<p>All commercial rates are eligible for the In Lieu of Deposit program. Otherwise, you must:</p>
<ul><li>Be a new PG&amp;E customer with a deposit amount of less than or equal to $10,000</li><li>Enroll before the third billing statement is generated for your account.</li><li>Maintain recurring payments and paperless billing on your account for 12 billing cycles.</li></ul>
<p> </p>
<h4>How to waive the security deposit</h4>
<ol><li>Sign up for paperless billing.</li><li>Sign up for autopay and choose “Pay Bill in Full” by the due date using a checking or savings account.</li><li>Keep paperless billing and recurring payments active for 12 months in a row.</li></ol>
<p> </p>
<p>The deposit will be re-applied to your account if:</p>
<ul><li>A recurring payment fails.</li><li>The monthly balance is not paid in full.</li><li>Your account is unenrolled from recurring payments or paperless billing.</li></ul>
<p> </p>
<h4>Surety Bond</h4>
<ol><li>Obtain a bond from your insurance company in the amount of the deposit request</li><li>List PG&amp;E as the sole beneficiary.</li><li>Complete the <a href="/assets/pge/docs/account/service-requests/Sec-Deposit-Surety-Bond-GAS-FORMS-62-4042.pdf">Surety Bond form (PDF)</a></li><li><a href="mailto:bonddesk&#64;pge.com">Email</a> copies of the form and the Surety bond to PG&amp;E.</li><li>PG&amp;E will notify you once the form is accepted. We&#39;ll then ask you to mail the original documents to:</li></ol>
<p>Pacific Gas and Electric Company<br />
ATTN: Bond Desk<br />
P. O. Box 8329<br />
Stockton, CA 95208-0010.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Irrevocable letter of credit</h4>
<p>Have your banking institution complete and indicate that it will fully guarantee any bill that is submitted for payment without prejudice or question.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>What are the requirements in the acceptance of an Irrevocable Letter of Credit?</h4>
<p>An Irrevocable Letter of Credit is completed by your banking institution and must be typed and not handwritten, with the exception of signatures.</p>
<ul><li>Issue in the account name as the PG&amp;E account is held, cannot be issued to a dba (doing business as) name</li><li>No service address, mailing address or PG&amp;E account number should be listed on the Irrevocable Letter of Credit</li><li>The bank officer or bank employee’s signature signing the Irrevocable Letter of Credit must be notarized, and accompanied by the notary’s All-Purpose Acknowledgement form (the optional section of the acknowledgement must be completed or have the bank’s officer/employees business card attached)</li></ul>
<p>The completed Irrevocable <a></a><a aria-label="Letter of Credit Form" href="https://www.pge.com/tariffs/assets/pdf/tariffbook/GAS_FORMS_79-1043.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Letter of Credit form</a> should be emailed to PG&amp;E for acceptance to <a href="mailto:bonddesk&#64;pge.com">bonddesk&#64;pge.com</a></p>
<ul><li>PG&amp;E will notify you once the form is accepted. We&#39;ll then ask you to mail the original documents to:</li></ul>
<p>             Pacific Gas and Electric Company<br />
             ATTN: Bond Desk<br />
             P. O. Box 8329<br />
             Stockton, CA 95208-0010.</p>
<p> </p>
<h4>Bill guarantee</h4>
<p>This must be signed by a guarantor who assumes all financial responsibility for the specified guaranteed amount in the event the customer fails to pay the closing bill.</p>
<p>The guarantor must be an established commercial customer with:</p>
<ul><li>12 consecutive months of service</li><li>No more than two late payments</li><li>The average monthly billings equal to at least 50 percent of the amount to be guaranteed.</li></ul>
<p>Ask your guarantor to contact the Credit Department. We must verify that they meet the guidelines before we send them the form.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>

 
</div>
</div>
      </div>
   </div>

</div>

</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
          <div class="secondary-navigation__content-description" id="guarantees" tabindex="0">
            <div class="secondary-navigation__title">
              <h2>Service guarantees</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="secondary-navigation__description">
              
              <div><div class="text section">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-092b554857&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-09-04T22:38:41Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>&lt;a id=\&#34;serviceguarantees\&#34;>&lt;/a>When your service is interrupted or in need of repair, you expect a reasonable and timely response. To spell out our commitment to prompt customer service for our customers, PG&amp;amp;E has implemented the following 10 service guarantees.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&lt;img width=\&#34;16\&#34; alt=\&#34;\&#34; src=\&#34;https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg\&#34;>&amp;nbsp;&lt;b>Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b>These service guarantees have been adopted by the California Public Utilities Commission (CPUC).&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-092b554857" class="cmp-text">
    <p><a id="serviceguarantees"></a>When your service is interrupted or in need of repair, you expect a reasonable and timely response. To spell out our commitment to prompt customer service for our customers, PG&amp;E has implemented the following 10 service guarantees.</p>
<p> </p>
<p><img width="16" alt="" src="https://www.pge.com/assets/pge/icons/ic-info-note.svg"/> <b>Note: </b>These service guarantees have been adopted by the California Public Utilities Commission (CPUC).</p>

</div>

    

</div>
<div class="faq-accordion section">
   <div class="cmp-accordion-faq">
      <div class="cmp-accordion-faq__container">
         <div class="text">


    

</div>
