         <div class="accordion">  <div id="accordion-f657d00cd1" class="cmp-accordion" data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-09-21T23:45:16Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
 <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-41ebd7121c&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 1: Missed appointments &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-41ebd7121c">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-41ebd7121c-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-41ebd7121c-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 1: Missed appointments </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-41ebd7121c-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-41ebd7121c-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-c142c544fa&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-09-29T00:30:13Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If PG&amp;amp;E does not meet the agreed-upon appointment time set during contact with our Call Center, we credit your account $30.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 1 does not apply:&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When a customer makes a same-day appointment&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When a service person misses the appointment to respond to an immediate emergency&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Gas pilot light appointments between October 15 and January 15&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Where access to the customer&#39;s location is not available or the customer is not ready for service&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-c142c544fa" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If PG&amp;E does not meet the agreed-upon appointment time set during contact with our Call Center, we credit your account $30. </p>
<p> </p>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 1 does not apply:<br />
</p>
<ul><li><p>When a customer makes a same-day appointment</p>
</li><li><p>When a service person misses the appointment to respond to an immediate emergency</p>
</li><li><p>Gas pilot light appointments between October 15 and January 15</p>
</li><li><p>Where access to the customer&#39;s location is not available or the customer is not ready for service</p>
</li><li><p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-7686cd46f3&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 2: Non-emergency investigations &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-7686cd46f3">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-7686cd46f3-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-7686cd46f3-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 2: Non-emergency investigations </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-7686cd46f3-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-7686cd46f3-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-8398f78171&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T02:01:43Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>PG&amp;amp;E will investigate non-emergency situations (check meter) and communicate results to a customer within seven days of a customer&#39;s request.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Check-meter appointments between October 15 and December 15 of each year will be scheduled within 10 workdays.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If an off-site meter test is required, PG&amp;amp;E will provide the results to the customer within 30 days.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If access is required to the customer&#39;s location, then an appointment is necessary.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Failure to meet the service guarantee will result in a $30 credit to the customer&#39;s account.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>An automatic credit to the customer&#39;s account would apply only if PG&amp;amp;E misses a scheduled appointment date.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If the appointment is scheduled beyond five workdays, the customer must notify PG&amp;amp;E to receive the credit.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If PG&amp;amp;E&#39;s records show that such scheduling was at the customer&#39;s request, the credit does not apply.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 2 does not apply:&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Company-generated orders&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Where access issues exist&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When the service person is required to respond to an immediate emergency&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-8398f78171" class="cmp-text">
    <ul><li>PG&amp;E will investigate non-emergency situations (check meter) and communicate results to a customer within seven days of a customer&#39;s request.</li><li>Check-meter appointments between October 15 and December 15 of each year will be scheduled within 10 workdays.</li><li>If an off-site meter test is required, PG&amp;E will provide the results to the customer within 30 days.</li><li>If access is required to the customer&#39;s location, then an appointment is necessary.</li></ul>
<p>Failure to meet the service guarantee will result in a $30 credit to the customer&#39;s account.</p>
<ul><li>An automatic credit to the customer&#39;s account would apply only if PG&amp;E misses a scheduled appointment date.</li><li>If the appointment is scheduled beyond five workdays, the customer must notify PG&amp;E to receive the credit.</li><li>If PG&amp;E&#39;s records show that such scheduling was at the customer&#39;s request, the credit does not apply. <br />
</li></ul>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 2 does not apply:<br />
</p>
<ul><li><p>Company-generated orders</p>
</li><li><p>Where access issues exist</p>
</li><li><p>When the service person is required to respond to an immediate emergency</p>
</li><li><p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-e7385e5e86&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 3: Emergency &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-e7385e5e86">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-e7385e5e86-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-e7385e5e86-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 3: Emergency </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-e7385e5e86-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-e7385e5e86-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-a272007e48&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-06-23T17:52:18Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>The Emergency Service Guarantee is not currently in effect.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-a272007e48" class="cmp-text">
    <p>The Emergency Service Guarantee is not currently in effect.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-3e8f27fd45&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 4: Complaint resolution &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-3e8f27fd45">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-3e8f27fd45-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-3e8f27fd45-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 4: Complaint resolution </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-3e8f27fd45-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-3e8f27fd45-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-8010f5dc1f&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-08-29T23:08:58Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>PG&amp;amp;E will decide on a course of action to resolve a complaint. We will provide it to the customer within three working days. PG&amp;amp;E will communicate the complaints resolution to the customer within:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>10 working days&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>30 working days when an off-site meter test is required or an on-site home audit is requested&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>Failure to meet the service guarantee will result in a $30 credit to the customer&#39;s account.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 4 does not apply:&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Applicable only to complaints referred to PG&amp;amp;E from the Consumer Affairs Branch (CAB) of the California Public Utilities Commission&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When resolution includes a pending outcome, which will appear beyond the guarantee period (e.g., a billing adjustment to be reflected on a future bill)&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When the customer requests additional actions (e.g., re-reading or testing meters, scheduling customer appointments) to resolve the complaint&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-8010f5dc1f" class="cmp-text">
    <p>PG&amp;E will decide on a course of action to resolve a complaint. We will provide it to the customer within three working days. PG&amp;E will communicate the complaints resolution to the customer within:</p>
<ul><li>10 working days</li><li>30 working days when an off-site meter test is required or an on-site home audit is requested</li></ul>
<p>Failure to meet the service guarantee will result in a $30 credit to the customer&#39;s account. </p>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 4 does not apply:<br />
</p>
<ul><li><p>Applicable only to complaints referred to PG&amp;E from the Consumer Affairs Branch (CAB) of the California Public Utilities Commission </p>
</li><li><p>When resolution includes a pending outcome, which will appear beyond the guarantee period (e.g., a billing adjustment to be reflected on a future bill)</p>
</li><li><p>When the customer requests additional actions (e.g., re-reading or testing meters, scheduling customer appointments) to resolve the complaint</p>
</li><li><p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c8914198aa&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 5: New meter installations &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c8914198aa">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c8914198aa-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c8914198aa-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 5: New meter installations </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c8914198aa-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c8914198aa-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-ff26a0a539&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-08-29T23:10:17Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If PG&amp;amp;E does not meet the agreed-upon date for new service meter installations and service turn-ons, we will automatically credit your account $50.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 5 does not apply:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Multiple (10 or more) gas and electric meter sets and service turn-ons for a contractor&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Meter installations where a service turn-on had not been requested by the customer&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When access to the location is not provided by the customer or the customer&#39;s equipment is not ready (for example, work has not been inspected by the city) for the meter installation&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When a service person misses the appointment due to the need to respond to an immediate emergency&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-ff26a0a539" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If PG&amp;E does not meet the agreed-upon date for new service meter installations and service turn-ons, we will automatically credit your account $50. </p>
<p> </p>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 5 does not apply:</p>
<ul><li><p>Multiple (10 or more) gas and electric meter sets and service turn-ons for a contractor</p>
</li><li><p>Meter installations where a service turn-on had not been requested by the customer</p>
</li><li><p>When access to the location is not provided by the customer or the customer&#39;s equipment is not ready (for example, work has not been inspected by the city) for the meter installation</p>
</li><li><p>When a service person misses the appointment due to the need to respond to an immediate emergency</p>
</li><li><p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-9f0dd27043&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 6: Electric service disruptions &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-9f0dd27043">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-9f0dd27043-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-9f0dd27043-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 6: Electric service disruptions </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-9f0dd27043-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-9f0dd27043-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-2beae72df0&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-11-19T18:36:19Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>PG&amp;amp;E will respond to customer calls reporting electric service interruptions within four hours by:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Restoring service; or&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Informing the customer, upon request, when service restoration is expected; or&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Crediting your account $30&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 6 does not apply:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When access to the area or customer location is not available&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When customers choose not to be notified of changes in the time service restoration is expected&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-2beae72df0" class="cmp-text">
    <p>PG&amp;E will respond to customer calls reporting electric service interruptions within four hours by:</p>
<ul><li>Restoring service; or</li><li>Informing the customer, upon request, when service restoration is expected; or</li><li>Crediting your account $30</li></ul>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 6 does not apply:</p>
<ul><li><p>When access to the area or customer location is not available</p>
</li><li><p>When customers choose not to be notified of changes in the time service restoration is expected</p>
</li><li><p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-99a6639097&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 7: Electric service restoration &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-99a6639097">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-99a6639097-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-99a6639097-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 7: Electric service restoration </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-99a6639097-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-99a6639097-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-3712829d84&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-10-24T17:36:12Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If PG&amp;amp;E does not restore electric service within 24 hours, we will credit your account $30 for each 24-hour period you are without service. This does not apply if the cause of the outage is absolutely beyond our control.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 7 does not apply:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Planned service interruptions&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>When access to the area or customer location is not available&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-3712829d84" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If PG&amp;E does not restore electric service within 24 hours, we will credit your account $30 for each 24-hour period you are without service. This does not apply if the cause of the outage is absolutely beyond our control.</p>
<p> </p>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 7 does not apply:</p>
<ul><li><p>Planned service interruptions</p>
</li><li><p>When access to the area or customer location is not available</p>
</li><li><p>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions</p>
</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-4c6f91523b&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 8: Commencing bills &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-4c6f91523b">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-4c6f91523b-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-4c6f91523b-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 8: Commencing bills </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-4c6f91523b-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-4c6f91523b-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-217c3d39d6&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-10-24T17:39:21Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If PG&amp;amp;E does not issue an accurate commencing bill to a new customer account within 60 days of service initiation, we will credit your account $30.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 8 does not apply:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Re-establishment of service following a shutoff for non-payment&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>When access to the area or customer location is not available on the date requested&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>When the customer fails to request service in a timely fashion, but only after occupying a new residence, creating a retroactive bill&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Cases of mail theft or a clear failure on the part of the U.S. Postal Service to deliver the first bill in a timely manner. PG&amp;amp;E must have documentation that notice was sent in a timely manner.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>When the customer provides inaccurate information at the time of requesting service initiation&lt;br>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Any major catastrophic event causing a disruption in transportation or communication within PG&amp;amp;E&#39;s service territory. For example:&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>The 1989 Loma Prieta Earthquake&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The 1991 Oakland Hills Firestorm&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The 2020 CZU Lightning Complex Fires&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-217c3d39d6" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If PG&amp;E does not issue an accurate commencing bill to a new customer account within 60 days of service initiation, we will credit your account $30. </p>
<p> </p>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 8 does not apply:</p>
<ul><li>Re-establishment of service following a shutoff for non-payment</li><li>When access to the area or customer location is not available on the date requested</li><li>When the customer fails to request service in a timely fashion, but only after occupying a new residence, creating a retroactive bill</li><li>Cases of mail theft or a clear failure on the part of the U.S. Postal Service to deliver the first bill in a timely manner. PG&amp;E must have documentation that notice was sent in a timely manner.</li><li>When the customer provides inaccurate information at the time of requesting service initiation<br />
</li><li>Any major catastrophic event causing a disruption in transportation or communication within PG&amp;E&#39;s service territory. For example:<ul><li>The 1989 Loma Prieta Earthquake</li><li>The 1991 Oakland Hills Firestorm</li><li>The 2020 CZU Lightning Complex Fires</li></ul>
</li></ul>
<p> </p>
<p> </p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-69ab09bdfa&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 9: Planned interruptions &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-69ab09bdfa">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-69ab09bdfa-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-69ab09bdfa-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 9: Planned interruptions </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-69ab09bdfa-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-69ab09bdfa-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-719e0f34a9&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-11-19T18:36:35Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>PG&amp;amp;E shall provide at least three days&#39; notice of a planned interruption in service.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Failure to meet the service guarantee will result in a $30 credit to the customer&#39;s account.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>This guarantee will require a customer call and PG&amp;amp;E investigation to determine if PG&amp;amp;E’s commitment to notify customers 72 hours in advance of planned interruptions was missed&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Customers notified of planned service interruptions 72 hours in advance may have their service interrupted on multiple occasions on the date(s).&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 9 does not apply:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>If the planned interruption is canceled due to other commitments and emergencies&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Customer supplies incorrect phone number, mailing address or if there is no access to the customer&#39;s location&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Service agreement is not established in PG&amp;amp;E&#39;s customer information system&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If an alert was sent to the customer of record, but the customer failed to notify tenants&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>If customer agrees to a shutdown without three days’ notice (PG&amp;amp;E will document the date and time of such discussion)&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>The U.S. Postal Service failed to deliver an alert in a timely manner, and PG&amp;amp;E has documentation that notice was sent timely (Sundays and holidays are excluded for the purposes of U.S. Postal Service mail alerts).&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Emergency interruptions, including:&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Equipment failure&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Imminent equipment failure&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>High/low voltage conditions&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Overload conditions&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Hazard removal from PG&amp;amp;E facilities&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Conditions that may affect public/employee safety&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Burned cross arms/poles&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Car-pole accidents&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>Downed powerlines&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-719e0f34a9" class="cmp-text">
    <p>PG&amp;E shall provide at least three days&#39; notice of a planned interruption in service.</p>
<ul><li>Failure to meet the service guarantee will result in a $30 credit to the customer&#39;s account.</li><li>This guarantee will require a customer call and PG&amp;E investigation to determine if PG&amp;E’s commitment to notify customers 72 hours in advance of planned interruptions was missed</li><li>Customers notified of planned service interruptions 72 hours in advance may have their service interrupted on multiple occasions on the date(s).</li></ul>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 9 does not apply:</p>
<ul><li>If the planned interruption is canceled due to other commitments and emergencies</li><li>Customer supplies incorrect phone number, mailing address or if there is no access to the customer&#39;s location</li><li>Service agreement is not established in PG&amp;E&#39;s customer information system</li><li>If an alert was sent to the customer of record, but the customer failed to notify tenants</li><li>If customer agrees to a shutdown without three days’ notice (PG&amp;E will document the date and time of such discussion)</li><li>The U.S. Postal Service failed to deliver an alert in a timely manner, and PG&amp;E has documentation that notice was sent timely (Sundays and holidays are excluded for the purposes of U.S. Postal Service mail alerts).</li><li>Emergency interruptions, including:<ul><li>Equipment failure</li><li>Imminent equipment failure</li><li>High/low voltage conditions</li><li>Overload conditions</li><li>Hazard removal from PG&amp;E facilities</li><li>Conditions that may affect public/employee safety</li><li>Burned cross arms/poles</li><li>Car-pole accidents</li><li>Downed powerlines </li></ul>
</li><li>During serious emergencies and/or storm conditions</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c297b1a0cb&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Guarantee 10: Service termination in error &#34;}}" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c297b1a0cb">
     <h3 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c297b1a0cb-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c297b1a0cb-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Guarantee 10: Service termination in error </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h3>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c297b1a0cb-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-f657d00cd1-item-c297b1a0cb-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-2b65ae1e3f&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2026-10-01T22:05:48Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Impacted customers will be eligible for a $100 credit adjustment if PG&amp;amp;E terminates service in error.&lt;br>\r\n&lt;br>\r\nThe following scenarios are eligible for Guarantee 10 — Service Termination in Error:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions due to an error in PG&amp;amp;E’s billing or meter reading processes when a customer has established service with PG&amp;amp;E or has taken all necessary steps to establish service with PG&amp;amp;E.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions due to non-payment of energy bills that occur after 8 a.m., where a customer made sufficient payment or a payment arrangement the&amp;nbsp;previous&amp;nbsp;day.&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 10 does not apply:&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions to assure customer safety&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions due to catastrophic events&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions that last less than one hour&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions to repair or replace PG&amp;amp;E gas and/or electric facilities&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions to diagnose the possibility of switched gas and/or electric meters&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions due to a customer denying PG&amp;amp;E access to service PG&amp;amp;E facilities, including gas and/or electric meters&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions that occur after 8 a.m. on the&amp;nbsp;same&amp;nbsp;day as payment, when a customer is subject to a service disconnect due to non-payment of an energy bill&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>&lt;p>Service interruptions when PG&amp;amp;E has no record of a customer at the service address&lt;/p>\r\n&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&lt;p>&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-2b65ae1e3f" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Impacted customers will be eligible for a $100 credit adjustment if PG&amp;E terminates service in error.<br />
<br />
The following scenarios are eligible for Guarantee 10 — Service Termination in Error:</p>
<ul><li><p>Service interruptions due to an error in PG&amp;E’s billing or meter reading processes when a customer has established service with PG&amp;E or has taken all necessary steps to establish service with PG&amp;E. </p>
</li><li><p>Service interruptions due to non-payment of energy bills that occur after 8 a.m., where a customer made sufficient payment or a payment arrangement the previous day.</p>
</li></ul>
<p>The following are circumstances when Guarantee 10 does not apply:</p>
<ul><li><p>Service interruptions to assure customer safety</p>
</li><li><p>Service interruptions due to catastrophic events</p>
</li><li><p>Service interruptions that last less than one hour</p>
</li><li><p>Service interruptions to repair or replace PG&amp;E gas and/or electric facilities</p>
</li><li><p>Service interruptions to diagnose the possibility of switched gas and/or electric meters</p>
</li><li><p>Service interruptions due to a customer denying PG&amp;E access to service PG&amp;E facilities, including gas and/or electric meters</p>
</li><li><p>Service interruptions that occur after 8 a.m. on the same day as payment, when a customer is subject to a service disconnect due to non-payment of an energy bill</p>
</li><li><p>Service interruptions when PG&amp;E has no record of a customer at the service address</p>
</li></ul>
<p> </p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>

 
</div>
</div>
      </div>
   </div>

</div>
<div class="faq-accordion section">
