         <div class="accordion">  <div id="accordion-5db663f61b" class="cmp-accordion" data-cmp-is="accordion" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-5db663f61b&#34;:{&#34;shownItems&#34;:[],&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-10-24T17:47:22Z&#34;}}" data-placeholder-text="false">
 <div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-5db663f61b-item-97eab92ec0&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Why did Pacific Gas and Electric Company adopt its ten service guarantees? &#34;}}" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-97eab92ec0">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-97eab92ec0-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-5db663f61b-item-97eab92ec0-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Why did Pacific Gas and Electric Company adopt its ten service guarantees? </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-97eab92ec0-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-5db663f61b-item-97eab92ec0-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-5078dcdc4f&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-10-24T17:46:59Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Service guarantees were adopted as part of Pacific Gas and Electric Company&#39;s 1999 and 2003 general rate cases, which were approved by the California Public Utilities Commission (CPUC).&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-5078dcdc4f" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Service guarantees were adopted as part of Pacific Gas and Electric Company&#39;s 1999 and 2003 general rate cases, which were approved by the California Public Utilities Commission (CPUC).</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-5db663f61b-item-d0a2d499f0&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Where does the money to pay customers for not meeting the service guarantees come from? &#34;}}" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-d0a2d499f0">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-d0a2d499f0-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-5db663f61b-item-d0a2d499f0-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">Where does the money to pay customers for not meeting the service guarantees come from? </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-d0a2d499f0-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-5db663f61b-item-d0a2d499f0-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0d0e38908b&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-06-23T18:04:14Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Payouts for not meeting a service guarantee are funded by Pacific Gas and Electric Company&#39;s shareholders.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0d0e38908b" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Payouts for not meeting a service guarantee are funded by Pacific Gas and Electric Company&#39;s shareholders.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-5db663f61b-item-bbb2e4f634&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;If I believe that I am owed a credit under the terms and conditions of the service guarantees, do I need to call Pacific Gas and Electric Company to receive the credit? &#34;}}" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-bbb2e4f634">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-bbb2e4f634-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-5db663f61b-item-bbb2e4f634-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">If I believe that I am owed a credit under the terms and conditions of the service guarantees, do I need to call Pacific Gas and Electric Company to receive the credit? </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-bbb2e4f634-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-5db663f61b-item-bbb2e4f634-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-19a4e2d140&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-08-29T23:50:16Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>No, with very few exceptions. &lt;/p>\r\n&lt;ul>\r\n&lt;li>Our system is set up to automatically identify circumstances where we did not meet any of the seven service guarantees and credit your account. &lt;/li>\r\n&lt;li>See the terms and conditions of the service guarantees for more details.&lt;/li>\r\n&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-19a4e2d140" class="cmp-text">
    <p>No, with very few exceptions. </p>
<ul><li>Our system is set up to automatically identify circumstances where we did not meet any of the seven service guarantees and credit your account. </li><li>See the terms and conditions of the service guarantees for more details.</li></ul>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-5db663f61b-item-a649746449&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How long will it take for a credit to appear on my bill? &#34;}}" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-a649746449">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-a649746449-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-5db663f61b-item-a649746449-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How long will it take for a credit to appear on my bill? </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-a649746449-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-5db663f61b-item-a649746449-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-afba815505&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T02:02:12Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Customers due a credit should see the credit on their bill within about two months.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-afba815505" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Customers due a credit should see the credit on their bill within about two months.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-5db663f61b-item-c5ba17c422&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;How will I be able to identify a service guarantee credit on my bill?&#34;}}" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-c5ba17c422">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-c5ba17c422-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-5db663f61b-item-c5ba17c422-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">How will I be able to identify a service guarantee credit on my bill?</span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-c5ba17c422-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-5db663f61b-item-c5ba17c422-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-0ff0268136&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2025-05-30T02:02:20Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>If you&#39;re due a service guarantee credit, it will appear as a credit &amp;quot;adjustment&amp;quot; on your future monthly bill.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-0ff0268136" class="cmp-text">
    <p>If you&#39;re due a service guarantee credit, it will appear as a credit &#34;adjustment&#34; on your future monthly bill.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>
<div class="cmp-accordion__item" data-cmp-hook-accordion="item" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;accordion-5db663f61b-item-e43632fbef&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;/apps/pge/components/pge-core/accordion/v1/accordion/item&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;What should I do if I do not receive my credit in two months? &#34;}}" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-e43632fbef">
     <h2 class="cmp-accordion__header">
         <button id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-e43632fbef-button" class="cmp-accordion__button" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-5db663f61b-item-e43632fbef-panel" aria-expanded="false" data-cmp-hook-accordion="button">
             <span class="cmp-accordion__title">What should I do if I do not receive my credit in two months? </span>
             <span class="cmp-accordion__icon"></span>
         </button>
     </h2>
     <div data-cmp-hook-accordion="panel" id="accordion-5db663f61b-item-e43632fbef-panel" class="cmp-accordion__panel cmp-accordion__panel--hidden " role="region" aria-labelledby="accordion-5db663f61b-item-e43632fbef-button"><div class="responsivegrid">


<div class="aem-Grid aem-Grid--12 aem-Grid--default--12 ">
    
    <div class="text aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;text-e258c4c381&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/text&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2024-05-23T22:35:18Z&#34;,&#34;xdm:text&#34;:&#34;&lt;p>Call our Customer Service Center at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=\&#34;tel:1-877-660-6789\&#34;>1-877-660-6789&lt;/a>.&lt;/p>\r\n&#34;}}" id="text-e258c4c381" class="cmp-text">
    <p>Call our Customer Service Center at <a href="tel:1-877-660-6789">1-877-660-6789</a>.</p>

</div>

    

</div>

    
</div>
</div>
</div>
 </div>

 
</div>
</div>
      </div>
   </div>

</div>

</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>


    

</div>
<div class="teaser-image teaser teaser-media-image--first background-gray-0 secondarybutton aem-GridColumn aem-GridColumn--default--12">
<div id="teaser-63d36ceb4a" class="cmp-teaser" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;teaser-63d36ceb4a&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;core/wcm/components/teaser/v1/teaser&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-09-26T18:16:22Z&#34;,&#34;dc:title&#34;:&#34;Community Choice Aggregation (CCA)&#34;,&#34;dc:description&#34;:&#34;&lt;ul>&lt;li>PG&amp;amp;E partners with each CCA in our service area to deliver electricity through our transmission and distribution system. &lt;/li>&lt;li>We handle service requests for each of our CCA partners.&lt;/li>&lt;/ul>\r\n&#34;,&#34;xdm:linkURL&#34;:&#34;/en/account/alternate-energy-providers/community-choice-aggregation.html&#34;}}">

    <div class="cmp-teaser__image">
<div data-cmp-is="image" data-cmp-lazythreshold="0" data-cmp-src="/en/account/service-requests/start-stop-transfer-service/_jcr_content/root/container_137824971/teaser_image.coreimg{.width}.jpeg/1695752182763/cca-electric-services-16-9.jpeg" data-asset="/content/dam/pge/images/account/cca-electric-services-16-9.jpg" data-asset-id="cdecd297-829f-4bd7-8343-24f9b8e1f3a0" id="image-image-63d36ceb4a" data-cmp-data-layer="{&#34;image-63d36ceb4a&#34;:{&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;pge/components/core/image&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-09-26T18:16:22Z&#34;,&#34;image&#34;:{&#34;repo:id&#34;:&#34;cdecd297-829f-4bd7-8343-24f9b8e1f3a0&#34;,&#34;repo:modifyDate&#34;:&#34;2023-06-23T00:18:07Z&#34;,&#34;@type&#34;:&#34;image/jpeg&#34;,&#34;repo:path&#34;:&#34;/content/dam/pge/images/account/cca-electric-services-16-9.jpg&#34;,&#34;xdm:smartTags&#34;:{&#34;interior&#34;:0.7636966705322266}}}}" class="cmp-image" itemscope itemtype="http://schema.org/ImageObject">

	
	
	
	
	        
	            
